1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
Your caravan roof costs the most and gets protected the least.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:07,600
This is a roof cover for caravans, six point five by three meters.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,120
It covers just the roof, not the whole van.

4
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:13,000
No heavy tarp to drag on alone in the wind.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,840
The fabric is heavy-duty 210D.

6
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:19,240
It takes rain, snow and sun all winter long.

7
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:22,120
Strap it down and cinch the drawcord at the edge.

8
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:24,560
It stays put even in howling wind.

9
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:26,640
One person can do it alone.

10
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:28,600
Nobody holds the other end.

11
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:32,320
Fold it into the included storage bag when not in use.

12
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,120
Takes no space in your storage box.

13
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:37,560
An easy way to protect the priciest part of your caravan.
